    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: messageArray.Array.size
      value: 11
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[0]'
      value: I have seen this before.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[1]'
      value: Some of the Spirits who have forgotten themselves
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[2]'
      value: try to remember, by <color=#00E2FB>haunting</color> things they find
        in the World.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[3]'
      value: They claim and possess something they find
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[4]'
      value: and take on its form. Or a form they think it should have.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[5]'
      value: This is powerful! You should be careful when facing them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[6]'
      value: They are much larger than the <color=#00E2FB>Ghosts</color> you encountered
        so far.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[7]'
      value: But I actually came along to warn you about something else.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[8]'
      value: 'I noticed that the <color=#00E2FB>Quicksand</color> you sometimes find
        in the <color=#00E2FB>Desert</color> '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[9]'
      value: is more harmful than the <color=#00E2FB>Swamp</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[10]'
      value: When you come across it, you probably should not dive in without a good
        reason ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
