      objectReference: {fileID: 1876935962}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: messageArray.Array.size
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[0]'
      value: What a cheerful and quirky creature the <color=#00E2FB>Armadillo</color>
        is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[1]'
      value: The <color=#00E2FB>Armadillo Soul</color> will grant you another very
        useful Power.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[2]'
      value: It gives you the strength to <color=#00E2FB>roll through and break</color>
        cracked Walls!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[3]'
      value: And if you learn to use it well, you can even <color=#00E2FB>dodge the
        damage</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[4]'
      value: that many dangerous objects and creatures would otherwise inflict upon
        you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[5]'
      value: <color=yellow>Press </color><color=red>RIGHT CLICK</color><color=yellow>
        to  <color=red>ROLL</color> like an </color><color=#00E2FB>Armadillo</color><color=yellow>,
        into the <color=red>DIRECTION</color> you are facing.</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[6]'
      value: '<color=yellow>While </color><color=red>ROLLING</color><color=yellow>
        press </color><color=red> A <color=yellow> or</color> D </color><color=yellow>
        to </color><color=red>SLOW</color><color=yellow> your </color><color=red>ROLL</color> '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[7]'
      value: <color=yellow> by <color=red>MOVING</color> into the </color><color=red>OPPOSITE
        DIRECTION</color><color=yellow>.</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[8]'
      value: <color=yellow>While </color><color=red>ROLLING</color><color=yellow>
        you can </color><color=red>BREAK</color><color=yellow> certain Walls </color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[9]'
      value: <color=yellow>and </color><color=red>DODGE DAMAGE</color><color=yellow>
        by </color><color=red>ROLLING THROUGH</color><color=yellow> some <color=#00E2FB>Traps</color><color=yellow>
        and </color><color=#00E2FB>Enemies</color><color=yellow>.</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9099826559163067317, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
